OL,3,GNEWSASoldiers start new training to
OL,4,A'adapt to current drone threats'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSoldiers are swapping military life for
OL,7,Funiversity study as part of a new
OL,8,Fdegree designed to prepare the next
OL,9,Fgeneration of drone and robotics
OL,10,Fengineers.
OL,12,FThe Autonomous Robotics programme has
OL,13,Fbeen developed in partnership with the
OL,14,FArmy, with military personnel studying
OL,15,Falongside civilian students on two and
OL,16,Fthree-year engineering degrees.
OL,18,FThe course is being delivered by the
OL,19,FNew Model Institute for Technology and
OL,20,FEngineering (NMITE), a specialist
OL,21,Fengineering higher education
OL,22,Finstitution in Hereford.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
